[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17524.39, "timestamp": "04:52:04", "text": "只有一根黄线，没有红线。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17527.03, "timestamp": "04:52:07", "text": "呃，再把第四根电线剪断。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17529.03, "timestamp": "04:52:09", "text": "一、二、三、四。嗨，diffuse。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17532.07, "timestamp": "04:52:12", "text": "接下来，我们来制作按钮。按钮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17536.07, "timestamp": "04:52:16", "text": "好的。黄色的。按下按钮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17540.31, "timestamp": "04:52:20", "text": "呃，按钮上写着什么？呃，按压。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17543.51, "timestamp": "04:52:23", "text": "好的。按钮是蓝色的。如果真有这么一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17546.948, "timestamp": "04:52:26", "text": "说明如果按钮是白色的。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17550.31, "timestamp": "04:52:30", "text": "呃，炸弹上有多少节电池？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17553.59, "timestamp": "04:52:33", "text": "炸弹？呃，四节小型电池。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17555.83, "timestamp": "04:52:35", "text": "好的。超过两个。呃，还有吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17559.67, "timestamp": "04:52:39", "text": "一个叫 FRK 的东西？标签是 FRK？不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17562.788, "timestamp": "04:52:42", "text": "不，不，好的。呃，按钮是黄色的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17565.67, "timestamp": "04:52:45", "text": "正确的？是的。黄色的。等等。抓住"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17569.35, "timestamp": "04:52:49", "text": "按钮。你好。红色条纹。红色条纹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17573.75, "timestamp": "04:52:53", "text": "嗯，等到计时器显示1分。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17577.19, "timestamp": "04:52:57", "text": "拒绝了。你好。呃，下一个是蓝色。按"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17579.19, "timestamp": "04:52:59", "text": "按钮。"}]